msgid "EasyTier"
msgstr "EasyTier"

msgid "EasyTier is a simple, secure, decentralized mesh VPN for intranet penetration, implemented in Rust."
msgstr "EasyTier 是一款基于 Rust 实现的极简、安全、去中心化内网穿透 Mesh VPN。"

