msgstr "刷新日志"

msgid "Clear Logs"
msgstr "清空日志"

msgid "Logs cleared."
msgstr "日志已清空。"

msgid "Enable Tunnel Traffic SNAT"
msgstr "开启隧道流量 SNAT"

msgid "Use OpenWrt system firewall to manage NAT for EasyTier tunnel and subnet traffic. Disabling this option disables source address masquerading to preserve real source IPs of remote peers and subnets in the local network."
msgstr "由 OpenWrt 系统防火墙统一接管 EasyTier 隧道及对端子网流量的地址转换。禁用此项将禁用源地址伪装，在局域网中保留对端节点和子网的真实源 IP。"

msgid "(Local)"
msgstr "(本机)"

msgid "Local Node Information"
msgstr "本端网络信息"

msgid "EasyTier IPv4"
msgstr "EasyTier IPv4"

msgid "Virtual Interface"
msgstr "虚拟网卡"

msgid "Client Version"
msgstr "客户端版本"

msgid "No connected remote peers found."
msgstr "未发现已连接的远程对等节点。"

msgid "Log Actions"
msgstr "日志操作"

msgid "Collecting data ..."
msgstr "正在收集数据..."

msgid "Failed to load logs: %s"
msgstr "加载日志失败：%s"

msgid "Failed to load peers: %s"
msgstr "加载对等节点失败：%s"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Network Topology"
msgstr "网络拓扑"

msgid "Refresh Topology"
msgstr "刷新拓扑"

msgid "Topology Actions"
msgstr "拓扑操作"

msgid "No topology data available."
msgstr "暂无可用拓扑数据。"

msgid "Failed to load topology: %s"
msgstr "加载拓扑失败：%s"

msgid "< 50ms (Optimal)"
msgstr "< 50ms (极佳)"

msgid "50 ~ 150ms (Good)"
msgstr "50 ~ 150ms (良好)"

msgid "> 150ms (Fair)"
msgstr "> 150ms (一般)"

msgid "Open Console"
msgstr "打开控制台"

msgid "Allow other peers in the network to route their Internet traffic through this node (Exit Node)."
msgstr "允许虚拟网络中的其他节点将此设备作为出口节点，并通过此设备访问互联网。"

msgid "Enable Exit Node"
msgstr "作为出口节点"

msgid "Enable Magic DNS"
msgstr "启用魔法 DNS"

msgid "Allow resolving peer node domain names (such as hostname.et.net) without memorizing virtual IP addresses. Automatically forwards DNS queries via dnsmasq."
msgstr "允许通过域名（如 主机名.et.net）直接访问对等节点，无需记忆虚拟 IP 地址。自动联动 dnsmasq 完成条件转发与防重绑定白名单设置。"

msgid "Magic DNS Domain Zone"
msgstr "魔法 DNS 域名区域"

msgid "The top-level domain zone for Magic DNS. Default is et.net."
msgstr "魔法 DNS 所使用的顶级域名区域后缀。默认为 et.net。"

msgid "Allow WAN Access"
msgstr "允许从 WAN 访问"

msgid "Automatically open and manage firewall traffic rules on WAN zone to allow incoming connections for external peers."
msgstr "自动在 WAN 区域创建并管理防火墙通信规则，放行 EasyTier 监听端口以允许外部节点主动接入。"

msgid "Proxy CIDRs"
msgstr "子网代理"

msgid "Proxy Network"
msgstr "子网代理"

msgid "The web console may consume significant memory, please enable as needed."
msgstr "Web 控制台可能会占用较多内存，请按需开启。"

msgid "Configuration File Path"
msgstr "配置文件路径"

msgid "Absolute path to the TOML configuration file. Ensure the file exists with valid EasyTier configuration."
msgstr "TOML 格式配置文件的绝对路径。请确保该文件已存在并包含有效的 EasyTier 配置。"

msgid "Local service is not running."
msgstr "本地服务未运行。"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Start Service"
msgstr "启动服务"

msgid "Starting service..."
msgstr "正在启动服务..."

msgid "Stopping service..."
msgstr "正在停止服务..."

msgid "The VPN network name to identify this virtual network (--network-name)."
msgstr "VPN 虚拟网络名称 (--network-name)。"

msgid "The secret phrase used to authorize and encrypt traffic (--network-secret)."
msgstr "用于节点认证与加密的密钥短语 (--network-secret)。"

msgid "Automatically determine and assign a virtual IP address (-d, --dhcp)."
msgstr "自动协商并分配虚拟网卡 IP 地址 (-d, --dhcp)。"

msgid "The static IPv4 address of this node (-i, --ipv4). Ignored when DHCP is enabled."
msgstr "本节点的静态 IPv4 地址 (-i, --ipv4)。启用 DHCP 时自动忽略。"

msgid "The static IPv6 address of this node (--ipv6)."
msgstr "本节点的静态 IPv6 地址 (--ipv6)。"

msgid "Initial connection peer node URLs (-p, --peers)."
msgstr "初始连接的对等节点地址 (-p, --peers)。"

msgid "Public discovery node URL (-e, --external-node)."
msgstr "公共发现节点 URL (-e, --external-node)。"

msgid "Subnet CIDRs to proxy and announce through this node (-n, --proxy-networks). Select from the detected local subnets below or enter custom CIDRs."
msgstr "通过此节点代理并通告的子网网段 (-n, --proxy-networks)。可直接下拉选择探测到的本地网段或手动输入。"

msgid "Allow other peers in the network to route their Internet traffic through this node (--enable-exit-node)."
msgstr "允许网络中的其他对等节点通过本节点路由外网流量 (--enable-exit-node)。"

msgid "Allow resolving peer node domain names (such as hostname.et.net) without memorizing virtual IP addresses (--accept-dns). Automatically forwards DNS queries via dnsmasq. Note: If third-party DNS tools (e.g. MosDNS, AdGuard Home, SmartDNS) are active, ensure this domain zone is excluded from hijacking."
msgstr "允许直接通过主机名解析节点 (--accept-dns)。自动通过 dnsmasq 转发解析请求至内置 DNS 服务器 (100.100.100.101)。注意：若启用了第三方 DNS 代理工具（如 MosDNS、AdGuard Home、SmartDNS 或分流插件），请确保将该域名区域加入直连/放行名单以防止被劫持导致解析失败。"

msgid "Specify the top-level domain zone for Magic DNS (--tld-dns-zone). Default is et.net. (FQDN ending with dot)."
msgstr "指定魔法 DNS 的顶级域名区域 (--tld-dns-zone)。默认值为 et.net.（以点结尾的 FQDN 根域）。"

msgid "Absolute path to the TOML configuration file (-c, --config-file). Ensure the file exists with valid EasyTier configuration."
msgstr "TOML 格式配置文件的绝对路径 (-c, --config-file)。请确保该文件已存在并包含有效的 EasyTier 配置。"

msgid "Remote web configuration server address (-w, --web-config)."
msgstr "远程 Web 配置服务器地址 (-w, --web-config)。"

msgid "Port for local CLI and RPC management portal (--rpc-portal)."
msgstr "本地 CLI 与 RPC 交互端口 (--rpc-portal)。"

msgid "Virtual TUN network interface name (--dev-name)."
msgstr "创建的虚拟 TUN 网卡接口名称 (--dev-name)。"

msgid "Enable multi-threaded packet processing for higher throughput (--multi-thread)."
msgstr "启用多线程数据包处理以提升高吞吐性能 (--multi-thread)。"

msgid "Zoom In"
msgstr "放大"

msgid "Zoom Out"
msgstr "缩小"

msgid "Reset View"
msgstr "复位视图"

msgid "(Drag to pan, scroll to zoom)"
msgstr "(按住拖拽平移，滚轮缩放画布)"









